# Captain dev workflow (mandatory)

Read **`docs/agents/captain-dev-workflow.md`** and **`docs/agents/agent-tooling-index.md`**.

**① Ticket → ② Plan + share → ③ Execute → ④ Review → ⑤ Promote**

Visual board: `npx -y lavish-axi docs/lavish/captain-workflow.html`

## ① Ticket first (default)

If the captain describes work, a bug, an idea, or pastes feedback — **create a
Linear ticket before anything else**, even if they did not ask.

```bash
npm run linear:ticket -- --chat "<their message>"
```

Skip only when they say **"no ticket"**. Reply with **PRP-###** + full Linear URL.

## ② Plan + share (before code)

**Do not implement** until the captain approves the plan.

1. Export shareable Markdown (friend / async review):

```bash
npm run linear:export -- --ticket PRP-### --out .lavish/plans/PRP-###-slug/ticket.md
```

2. Lavish plan in the **same folder**:

```bash
npm run lavish:plan -- --ticket PRP-### --title "..." --summary "..."
npx -y lavish-axi playbook plan
npx -y lavish-axi .lavish/plans/PRP-###-slug/plan.html
npx -y lavish-axi poll <plan.html>
```

3. **Images:** `--image <absolute-path>` for every captain attachment.
4. Optional public share: `npx -y lavish-axi share <plan.html>`
5. **Stop** until captain says **"approved — build"**.

Skip only when they say **"skip plan"** (hotfix).

## ③ Execute

- Keeper branch + sandbox port: see **`local-agent-branch.mdc`** (this pane).
- Read `docs/portal-ui-system.md` before portal UI; `docs/agents/<area>.md` before features.
- MCP: `.cursor/mcp.json` — see agent-tooling-index.
- Reference **PRP-###** in commits.

## ④ Review

Test on **this pane's sandbox URL**. Update Linear. Do not merge to `prakrit` yourself.

## ⑤ Promote (captain only)

```bash
bin/fm-proplane-promote-to-prakrit.sh <keeper-branch>
```

## Production data (never)

Dev/test Supabase only. See `no-production-data-writes.mdc`.
